<section image-layout="blank" id="OtJilL6CXj" vertical-align="end" background-overlay="tint" background-overlay-intensity="0.28" card-margin-hidden="true"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/7jKjzQlb8msV62R3bA5FW.png" saved-media-id="yho61y6x3mjuk91" source="image.ai-generated" background="true" image-style="sculptural-hair-editorial" alt="Medium-format fashion beauty photograph of an adult Black model in profile, shoulder-length sculptural hair caught in slight controlled motion with every strand visible, restrained oxblood clothing, warm directional studio light, gallery-cream backdrop with quiet open space on the left, subtle film grain, no text or lettering" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1920,&quot;height&quot;:1088}"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="JYby5kOCDa" vertical-align="end"><p role="eyebrow">Lune &amp; Ash · Autumn/Winter 2026</p><display size="lg">Undone on Purpose</display><p font-size="lg" style="padding-right: 42%;">Eight looks from the studio floor, and exactly what to ask for.</p><spacer size="18pt"></spacer><labels><label variant="solid">AI concept imagery — not salon work</label></labels></grid-item></grid></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="2qIyTYpN-I"><grid spacing="medium"><grid-item id="Jh9j6lqndf" vertical-align="center" colspan="38"><p role="eyebrow">The season’s idea</p><h2>Effort you can’t see</h2><p>Every look is built for wet mornings, wool collars and no round brush.</p><grid spacing="small"><grid-item id="HpSoOLPtJG" cell-style="subtle" colspan="30"><h4>Loose shapes</h4><p font-size="sm">Recognisable bobs, shags and crops, worn loose instead of prescribed.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="j1EiTi-BhR" cell-style="subtle" colspan="30"><h4>Blended placement</h4><p font-size="sm">Dimensional colour grows out without a hard line.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="knEgB0TiIK" cell-style="subtle" colspan="30"><h4>Glossed finish</h4><p font-size="sm">Shine makes colour read richer and hair look healthier.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="YcKaK33pki" background-color="accent" colspan="30"><h4>The trade</h4><p font-size="sm">More precision in the chair. Less work at home.</p></grid-item></grid><p role="caption">Trend context: <a href="https://www.marieclaire.com/beauty/hair/best-fall-2026-haircuts/">Marie Claire</a> · <a href="https://menagerienc.com/lived-in-color-spring-2026-trend/">Menagerie</a> · <a href="https://www.cosmopolitan.com/style-beauty/beauty/a73643155/fall-hair-color-trends-2026/">Cosmopolitan</a></p></grid-item><grid-item id="WsFSGM7YrT" background-overlay="tint" background-overlay-intensity="0.16" vertical-align="end" padding="18pt" colspan="22"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/CjqSIUMx1COY6QBVXzgeW.png" saved-media-id="un09i8999beigpv" source="image.ai-generated" background="true" image-style="sculptural-hair-editorial" alt="Medium-format fashion beauty portrait of an adult model in three-quarter profile, loose layered hair tucked into a wool collar after light rain, realistic strand separation and soft movement, restrained espresso wardrobe, warm studio light against a gallery-cream ground, subtle film grain, no text or lettering" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1248,&quot;height&quot;:1664}"><labels><label variant="solid">AI concept imagery — not salon work</label></labels></grid-item></grid></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="FsY_I9VAtD" vertical-align="center"><grid spacing="medium"><grid-item id="sYCkpOIINn" vertical-align="center" colspan="37"><hr color="accent" thickness="md" width="xs"><blockquote><p font-size="30pt">“The strongest hair right now feels designed, but not over-designed.”</p></blockquote><p font-size="sm">Adam Federico, Vice President of Technical Education, R+Co · <a href="https://www.marieclaire.com/beauty/hair/best-fall-2026-haircuts/">Marie Claire</a></p><p>It’s the sentence we kept coming back to while building this collection.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="2Si9jxMWkK" background-overlay="tint" background-overlay-intensity="0.14" vertical-align="end" padding="18pt" colspan="23"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/xGGx4XhboWzQs_nL8BqYc.png" saved-media-id="urkl62zr0gu0l16" source="image.ai-generated" background="true" image-style="sculptural-hair-editorial" alt="Macro fashion beauty photograph of an adult model turning into profile, softly imperfect layers separating around the cheek and ear, realistic strand detail and controlled movement, warm directional studio light, rose-clay and gallery-cream palette, subtle film grain, no text or lettering" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1248,&quot;height&quot;:1664}"><labels><label variant="solid">AI concept imagery — not salon work</label></labels></grid-item></grid></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="Pf5t5tWW78" background-color="heading" card-margin-hidden="true"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="g8SRt4AVWi" vertical-align="center" colspan="36"><h1>Part One — The Cuts</h1></grid-item><grid-item id="0-PPjOvMQS" background-overlay="tint" background-overlay-intensity="0.12" vertical-align="end" padding="18pt" colspan="24"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/nw-ZKezSMdtIL_-uLV-9s.png" saved-media-id="a1cture1cojf4ux" source="image.ai-generated" background="true" image-style="sculptural-hair-editorial" alt="Medium-format fashion beauty silhouette of an adult model in clean side profile, short sculptural haircut fully visible from crown to nape, restrained dark wardrobe, warm rim light against a gallery-cream background, subtle film grain, no text or lettering" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1248,&quot;height&quot;:1664}"><labels><label variant="solid">AI concept imagery — not salon work</label></labels></grid-item></grid></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="imUxXgalcq"><grid spacing="medium"><grid-item id="o9weRKh3M-" background-overlay="tint" background-overlay-intensity="0.12" vertical-align="end" padding="18pt" colspan="35"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/uvSkaWVPKFa4-kx9N0eNB.png" saved-media-id="efgoqx5y2ngkwwx" source="image.ai-generated" background="true" image-style="sculptural-hair-editorial" alt="Full-height medium-format fashion beauty portrait of an adult East Asian model with a soft jaw-to-collarbone boyfriend bob tucked behind one ear, airy unblunt perimeter and realistic strand detail, restrained cream knit, warm directional studio light, gallery-cream background, subtle film grain, no text or lettering" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1248,&quot;height&quot;:1664}"><labels><label variant="solid">AI concept imagery — not salon work</label></labels></grid-item><grid-item id="mQehZSTtzQ" vertical-align="center" colspan="25"><display size="md">01</display><h2>The Boyfriend Bob</h2><p>A soft jaw-to-collarbone bob with air at the edge. It tucks behind an ear and looks worn-in from day one.</p><p font-size="sm"><b>Ask for</b> · A soft perimeter with invisible weight removed inside.</p><p font-size="sm"><b>Best on</b> · Straight to loose-wave hair, medium density.</p><p font-size="sm"><b>Home</b> · Air-dry. Add one flat-iron pass only if you want it.</p><p role="caption">Trend context: <a href="https://www.allure.com/story/fall-hair-trends-2026">Allure</a></p></grid-item></grid></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="mgpStmYKmT"><grid direction="vertical" spacing="none"><grid-item id="GQR9GLVI7Y" background-overlay="tint" background-overlay-intensity="0.1" vertical-align="end" padding="18pt" rowspan="35"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/cEx5c9gVY0hsPQZuS59B2.png" saved-media-id="pyg69edm1fgep4v" source="image.ai-generated" background="true" image-style="sculptural-hair-editorial" alt="Panoramic medium-format fashion beauty motion study of an adult model with long shattered layers sweeping across the shoulders, strong perimeter held through the length and face-framing pieces moving in warm studio air, restrained espresso wardrobe, gallery-cream background, realistic strand detail, subtle film grain, no text or lettering" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1920,&quot;height&quot;:1088}"><labels><label variant="solid">AI concept imagery — not salon work</label></labels></grid-item><grid-item id="DO6uXYRkaF" rowspan="25"><grid spacing="medium"><grid-item id="76AG4aqHmj" vertical-align="center" colspan="20"><display size="md">02</display><h2>Long, Shattered Layers</h2></grid-item><grid-item id="jzLB63XhxL" vertical-align="center" colspan="40"><p>Keep the length. Break the weight. A strong perimeter holds the shape while the face-framing pieces do the moving.</p><p font-size="sm"><b>Ask for</b> · A strong edge, dynamic face frame and little wispy disconnection.</p><p font-size="sm"><b>Best on</b> · Thick or coarse hair carrying weight at the ends.</p><p font-size="sm"><b>Home</b> · Rough-dry upside down. Wait until 80% dry for product.</p><p role="caption">Trend context: <a href="https://www.whowhatwear.com/beauty/hair/autumn-hair-trends-2026">Who What Wear</a> · <a href="https://www.marieclaire.com/beauty/hair/best-fall-2026-haircuts/">Marie Claire</a></p></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="351Jle_M3r"><grid spacing="medium"><grid-item id="GolGvSd-vl" padding="0" colspan="34"><grid spacing="small"><grid-item id="kJPsd-GiQK" background-overlay="tint" background-overlay-intensity="0.12" vertical-align="end" padding="14pt" colspan="30"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/P1c2Y_SfOCu3vbf1IWBaT.png" saved-media-id="15lzizcgsuepk9h" source="image.ai-generated" background="true" image-style="sculptural-hair-editorial" alt="Front-facing medium-format fashion beauty portrait of an adult model with wispy cloud bangs resting softly across the forehead, airy points blending into face-framing layers, restrained rose-clay top, warm directional studio light, gallery-cream ground, realistic strand detail, subtle film grain, no text or lettering" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1248,&quot;height&quot;:1664}"><p role="caption">AI concept imagery — not salon work</p></grid-item><grid-item id="aonk6YQNgi" background-overlay="tint" background-overlay-intensity="0.12" vertical-align="end" padding="14pt" colspan="30"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/uDNvsjiF104eld0v-E6cS.png" saved-media-id="f6c5kcef9llfrwn" source="image.ai-generated" background="true" image-style="sculptural-hair-editorial" alt="Three-quarter profile medium-format fashion beauty portrait of an adult model pushing soft cloud bangs aside so they disappear into longer face-framing layers, hair fully visible, warm studio light, restrained espresso wardrobe, gallery-cream background, realistic strand detail, subtle film grain, no text or lettering" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1248,&quot;height&quot;:1664}"><p role="caption">AI concept imagery — not salon work</p></grid-item></grid></grid-item><grid-item id="4usb-4UHQA" vertical-align="center" colspan="26"><display size="md">03</display><h2>Cloud Bangs</h2><p>Wispy, flexible and deliberately low stakes. Wear them across the forehead or push them into the length.</p><p font-size="sm"><b>Ask for</b> · Airy bangs, point-cut into the face frame.</p><p font-size="sm"><b>Best on</b> · Anyone nervous about committing to a fringe.</p><p font-size="sm"><b>Upkeep</b> · A free fringe trim between appointments, in and out in ten minutes.</p><p role="caption">Trend context: <a href="https://www.allure.com/story/fall-hair-trends-2026">Allure</a></p></grid-item></grid></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="HZRfeuUTZJ"><grid spacing="medium"><grid-item id="aR_3Wn2-Mg" vertical-align="center" colspan="25"><display size="md">04</display><h2>The Quiet Crop</h2><p>A short shape cut with your texture, not against it. A little imperfection stays in because that is what makes it yours.</p><p font-size="sm"><b>Ask for</b> · A crop shaped around your growth pattern and cowlicks.</p><p font-size="sm"><b>Best on</b> · Wave and curl, where texture carries the shape.</p><p font-size="sm"><b>Home</b> · A pea of cream on damp hair. Fingers only.</p><p role="caption">Trend context: <a href="https://www.marieclaire.com/beauty/hair/best-fall-2026-haircuts/">Marie Claire</a></p></grid-item><grid-item id="LqUgMprpRq" background-overlay="tint" background-overlay-intensity="0.1" vertical-align="end" padding="18pt" colspan="35"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/DwOB2C5dhlrGITdf0VK1h.png" saved-media-id="316tb507d0wrvxm" source="image.ai-generated" background="true" image-style="sculptural-hair-editorial" alt="Offset medium-format fashion beauty profile of an adult model with a quiet cropped haircut following natural curls and cowlicks, slightly imperfect texture visible around the crown and temple, restrained dark knit, warm directional studio light, gallery-cream background, realistic strand detail, subtle film grain, no text or lettering" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1248,&quot;height&quot;:1664}"><labels><label variant="solid">AI concept imagery — not salon work</label></labels></grid-item></grid></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="rIaUATlcQ7" background-color="accent" card-margin-hidden="true"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="vyBrj-zZlo" vertical-align="center" colspan="36"><h1>Part Two — The Colour</h1></grid-item><grid-item id="-Pl6jHehSH" background-overlay="tint" background-overlay-intensity="0.08" vertical-align="end" padding="18pt" colspan="24"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/J1lJrmPg_Xv7Aci8XMCv2.png" saved-media-id="de9p3zg0ukyw2ms" source="image.ai-generated" background="true" image-style="sculptural-hair-editorial" alt="Medium-format fashion beauty portrait from behind of an adult model with dimensional brunette colour shifting from espresso roots to warm reflective lengths, hair filling the frame with realistic glossy strands, gallery-cream ground, warm directional studio light, subtle film grain, no text or lettering" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1248,&quot;height&quot;:1664}"><labels><label variant="solid">AI concept imagery — not salon work</label></labels></grid-item></grid></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="1IYlAfkdJL"><grid spacing="medium"><grid-item id="uNGeMh2in5" vertical-align="center" colspan="24"><display size="md">05</display><h2>Spiced Smudge</h2><p>A warm veil at the roots melts into dimensional brunette. It adds spice without going copper, then softens as it grows.</p><p font-size="sm"><b>Ask for</b> · A dimensional base with a warm root smudge blended through.</p><p font-size="sm"><b>Why</b> · Richness without high-maintenance brightness.</p><p font-size="sm"><b>Grow-out</b> · A soft fade, not a line.</p><p role="caption">Trend context: <a href="https://www.cosmopolitan.com/style-beauty/beauty/a73643155/fall-hair-color-trends-2026/">Cosmopolitan</a></p></grid-item><grid-item id="jOMMqhuVGX" padding="0" colspan="36"><grid spacing="small"><grid-item id="AhEur-NMqd" background-overlay="tint" background-overlay-intensity="0.1" vertical-align="end" padding="14pt" colspan="37"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/wc5IfT7SjW4-A1hK2omw8.png" saved-media-id="3rd9qh1ku03uzqh" source="image.ai-generated" background="true" image-style="sculptural-hair-editorial" alt="Medium-format fashion beauty portrait of an adult model with dimensional brunette hair and a soft spiced root smudge, warm brown depth without copper, full hair visible in three-quarter profile, restrained cream wardrobe, gallery-cream backdrop, warm directional light, subtle film grain, no text or lettering" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1248,&quot;height&quot;:1664}"><p role="caption">AI concept imagery — not salon work</p></grid-item><grid-item id="Ne9bzY1a65" background-overlay="tint" background-overlay-intensity="0.1" vertical-align="end" padding="14pt" colspan="23"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/82K0nGmWPLGqXBDxrnEkl.png" saved-media-id="4ia4jg7eyq4z9ng" source="image.ai-generated" background="true" image-style="sculptural-hair-editorial" alt="Macro fashion beauty photograph of a dimensional brunette root area, warm spiced tone diffusing seamlessly into deeper espresso lengths, realistic parting and individual strands under warm studio light, gallery-cream ground, subtle film grain, no text or lettering" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1248,&quot;height&quot;:1664}"><p role="caption">AI concept imagery — not salon work</p></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="c2TKbjCtpT"><grid spacing="medium"><grid-item id="oqjqiqUgS_" padding="0" colspan="36"><grid direction="vertical" spacing="small"><grid-item id="GJyEvlbxFu" background-overlay="tint" background-overlay-intensity="0.1" vertical-align="end" padding="14pt" rowspan="46"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/qdaGWt-fWxT8LWczGWVYY.png" saved-media-id="70it4wpkfm8prcl" source="image.ai-generated" background="true" image-style="sculptural-hair-editorial" alt="Wide medium-format fashion beauty profile of an adult model with khaki bronde hair, muted gold balanced by a whisper of ash, seamless lift with no foil line, hair flowing across the shoulder, restrained espresso wardrobe, warm studio light, gallery-cream background, subtle film grain, no text or lettering" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1920,&quot;height&quot;:1088}"><p role="caption">AI concept imagery — not salon work</p></grid-item><grid-item id="_ygsSGYTre" background-overlay="tint" background-overlay-intensity="0.08" vertical-align="end" padding="12pt" rowspan="14"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/b04LY43oaMcE3ADU3e_AR.png" saved-media-id="y9yivxfyt84vy1n" source="image.ai-generated" background="true" image-style="sculptural-hair-editorial" alt="Macro horizontal fashion beauty detail of khaki bronde strands crossing from muted golden mid-lengths into softly ashy ends, realistic hair texture and restrained shine under warm directional studio light, gallery-cream ground, subtle film grain, no text or lettering" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1920,&quot;height&quot;:1088}"><p role="caption">AI concept imagery — not salon work</p></grid-item></grid></grid-item><grid-item id="dIpCPAXDgM" vertical-align="center" colspan="24"><display size="md">06</display><h2>Khaki Bronde</h2><p>Muted gold with a whisper of ash. A seamless lift brightens the hair; a colour melt blends the tones over the top.</p><p font-size="sm"><b>Ask for</b> · “A seamless lift and a colour melt.”</p><p font-size="sm"><b>Best on</b> · Natural level 6–7 wanting lighter, not blonde.</p><p font-size="sm"><b>Reality</b> · Nowhere near green, despite the name.</p><p role="caption">Trend context: <a href="https://www.refinery29.com/en-us/hair-color-trends-2026">Refinery29</a></p></grid-item></grid></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="lQeJIII5I-" card-margin-hidden="true"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/v6ZJcWv6OwIZ4482wF4tH.png" saved-media-id="xw6go2p8vbj5ni1" source="image.ai-generated" background="true" image-style="sculptural-hair-editorial" alt="Full-bleed medium-format fashion beauty portrait of an adult model with deep glossy espresso hair, long dark lengths reflecting a narrow ribbon of warm studio light, realistic individual strands and low-contrast tone-on-tone depth, restrained oxblood wardrobe, dark espresso background with quiet space on the left, subtle film grain, no text or lettering" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1920,&quot;height&quot;:1088}"><freeform><box type="content" x="54" y="48" w="458" h="444" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 28pt 30pt;"><display size="md">07</display><h2>Glossy Espresso</h2><p>A zero-lift acidic glaze lays translucent tone and shine over a natural dark base. It replaces brassy ends with depth, without lightener.</p><p font-size="sm"><b>Ask for</b> · A demi or acidic gloss to refine your existing depth.</p><p font-size="sm"><b>Chair time</b> · Shorter than a cut.</p><p font-size="sm"><b>Pair with</b> · Tone-on-tone colour drenching for low-contrast dimension.</p><p role="caption">Trend context: <a href="https://www.wella.com/professional/en-US/blog/hair-color/fall-hair-color-trends">Wella Professionals</a></p></box><box type="content" x="624" y="466" w="280" background-color="accent" style="padding: 9pt 12pt;"><p role="caption">AI concept imagery — not salon work</p></box></freeform></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="NgjTp8Ofwf"><grid spacing="medium"><grid-item id="dSZmBE5ng-" vertical-align="center" colspan="26"><display size="md">08</display><h2>Champagne Blonde, With the Money Piece</h2><p>Warm blonde between platinum and gold, carrying peach and honey. Two brighter face-framing pieces do most of the visual work.</p><p font-size="sm"><b>Ask for</b> · Champagne toning and a face frame matched to your skin.</p><p font-size="sm"><b>Pair with</b> · A shadow root for softer grow-out.</p><p font-size="sm"><b>Commitment</b> · Brightness concentrated where it has the most impact.</p><p role="caption">Trend context: <a href="https://www.fergaldoylehair.com/post/blonde-hair-trends-2026-bristol-colour-expert-guide">Fergal Doyle Hair</a> · <a href="https://monarchstudiosd.com/2026/05/07/money-piece-highlights-guide/">Monarch Studios</a></p></grid-item><grid-item id="ABiwmCBbuR" padding="0" colspan="34"><grid spacing="small"><grid-item id="4D42gK138M" background-overlay="tint" background-overlay-intensity="0.1" vertical-align="end" padding="14pt" colspan="30"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/ce3dmmlVM8KHd76hvMQ9Y.png" saved-media-id="fns8rur7z15awmf" source="image.ai-generated" background="true" image-style="sculptural-hair-editorial" alt="Front-facing medium-format fashion beauty portrait of an adult model with luminous champagne blonde hair carrying peach and honey tones, two brighter money-piece sections framing the face, restrained cream wardrobe, warm directional light, gallery-cream backdrop, subtle film grain, no text or lettering" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1248,&quot;height&quot;:1664}"><p role="caption">AI concept imagery — not salon work</p></grid-item><grid-item id="kCjbvqljiQ" background-overlay="tint" background-overlay-intensity="0.1" vertical-align="end" padding="14pt" colspan="30"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/FrbtbaEaLLM1KZDg8MGDj.png" saved-media-id="8nt92bb0399gynz" source="image.ai-generated" background="true" image-style="sculptural-hair-editorial" alt="Three-quarter profile medium-format fashion beauty portrait showing champagne blonde face-framing pieces and a soft shadow root, luminous warm strands fully visible around the cheek and temple, gallery-cream background, warm studio light, subtle film grain, no text or lettering" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1248,&quot;height&quot;:1664}"><p role="caption">AI concept imagery — not salon work</p></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="VgbjcfECww"><grid spacing="medium"><grid-item id="_qIfpB-W8s" background-overlay="tint" background-overlay-intensity="0.14" vertical-align="end" padding="14pt" colspan="12"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/5jG47MFKN1SFSE0WLQlCn.png" saved-media-id="vmot0lv06cujmtk" source="image.ai-generated" background="true" image-style="sculptural-hair-editorial" alt="Tall medium-format fashion beauty photograph from behind of an adult model seated for a consultation, long dimensional hair fully visible down the back, restrained salon cape, warm directional studio light against a gallery-cream wall, subtle film grain, no text or lettering" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1248,&quot;height&quot;:1664}"><p role="caption">AI concept imagery — not salon work</p></grid-item><grid-item id="xgaCC8aIX-" colspan="48"><h2>What each look actually costs you in time</h2><p font-size="sm">The honest version, so nobody books a colour they can’t maintain. Studio guidance only; we adjust it to your hair.</p><table col-widths="[32,28,40]" header-row="true" borders="rows" striped="false"><tbody><tr><td><p>Look</p></td><td><p>Back in the chair</p></td><td><p>Between visits</p></td></tr><tr><td><p font-size="sm">Boyfriend Bob</p></td><td><p font-size="sm">8–10 weeks</p></td><td><p font-size="sm">Nothing</p></td></tr><tr><td><p font-size="sm">Shattered Layers</p></td><td><p font-size="sm">10–12 weeks</p></td><td><p font-size="sm">Nothing</p></td></tr><tr><td><p font-size="sm">Cloud Bangs</p></td><td><p font-size="sm">6 weeks</p></td><td><p font-size="sm">Free fringe trim</p></td></tr><tr><td><p font-size="sm">Quiet Crop</p></td><td><p font-size="sm">5–6 weeks</p></td><td><p font-size="sm">Nothing</p></td></tr><tr><td><p font-size="sm">Spiced Smudge</p></td><td><p font-size="sm">12–14 weeks</p></td><td><p font-size="sm">Gloss at 8 weeks</p></td></tr><tr><td><p font-size="sm">Khaki Bronde</p></td><td><p font-size="sm">12–16 weeks</p></td><td><p font-size="sm">Gloss at 8 weeks</p></td></tr><tr><td><p font-size="sm">Glossy Espresso</p></td><td><p font-size="sm">8 weeks</p></td><td><p font-size="sm">Nothing</p></td></tr><tr><td><p font-size="sm">Champagne Blonde</p></td><td><p font-size="sm">8–10 weeks</p></td><td><p font-size="sm">Toner at 6 weeks</p></td></tr></tbody></table></grid-item></grid></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="0CEDulZH4U"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="4G21MndFY3"><h2>Bring three photos, not thirty</h2><p>The consultation works when we can see the edges of what you want.</p><grid marker="number" marker-rule="true" marker-position="above" marker-numbering-format="decimal-leading-zero" spacing="medium" image-aspect="landscape" image-shape="square"><grid-item id="i5rX05XxiJ" colspan="20"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/L2wB8MPNF1Tcu5ta76ZQY.png" saved-media-id="b293y2rjfyw3nmr" source="image.ai-generated" image-style="sculptural-hair-editorial" alt="Medium-format documentary fashion beauty photograph of two printed hairstyle reference portraits held side by side in adult hands, one soft bob and one rigid blunt bob, hair clearly visible in both prints, gallery-cream tabletop, warm directional light, subtle film grain, no text or lettering" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1920,&quot;height&quot;:1088}"><p role="caption">AI concept imagery — not salon work</p><h4>One love. One no.</h4><p font-size="sm">The photo you dislike often tells us more about the edge, weight or finish.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="ih8MGU5920" colspan="20"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/DZTxfrf2GyK4Vnn6FyrRY.png" saved-media-id="gzwoilyjqhs1hr3" source="image.ai-generated" image-style="sculptural-hair-editorial" alt="Medium-format fashion beauty morning study of an adult model at a mirror with naturally air-dried hair, a comb, flat iron and dryer resting unused on a gallery-cream counter, warm window-like studio light, realistic strands, subtle film grain, no text or lettering" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1920,&quot;height&quot;:1088}"><p role="caption">AI concept imagery — not salon work</p><h4>Your real mornings</h4><p font-size="sm">Tell us the minutes you have and the tools you actually own.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="WQOoUWZj_-" colspan="20"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/GHSpKWDfeZ91fz1p6DCs-.png" saved-media-id="mmz6j47sw9en2ux" source="image.ai-generated" image-style="sculptural-hair-editorial" alt="Medium-format fashion beauty back view of an adult model showing natural roots, older mid-length colour and lighter ends with realistic regrowth history, hair fully visible against a gallery-cream ground, warm directional studio light, subtle film grain, no text or lettering" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1920,&quot;height&quot;:1088}"><p role="caption">AI concept imagery — not salon work</p><h4>Your colour history</h4><p font-size="sm">Bring the last two years, including box dye. It changes what is possible today.</p></grid-item></grid><p><b>We’ll tell you honestly if the right result needs two appointments.</b></p></grid-item></grid></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="Opj1Pyg2lh"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="Uj-lTopT41" vertical-align="center" colspan="38"><hr color="accent" thickness="md" width="xs"><h1>Book the consultation. Decide after.</h1><p font-size="lg">Fifteen minutes, no charge, no obligation to book a service that day.</p><spacer size="18pt"></spacer><p font-size="sm"><b>Lune &amp; Ash</b> · 214 Mill Street, Portland, Oregon</p><p font-size="sm">Tuesday–Saturday, 9am–7pm</p><p font-size="sm">hello@luneandash.example · Consultations bookable online</p><spacer mode="fill"></spacer><p role="caption"><i>Lune &amp; Ash is a fictional salon. Imagery is concept photography, not client work; upkeep guidance, team and contact details are illustrative.</i></p></grid-item><grid-item id="9N-t0SkNMl" background-overlay="tint" background-overlay-intensity="0.1" vertical-align="end" padding="18pt" colspan="22"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/RXAziAbKKEPe50vT8MLZV.png" saved-media-id="rf14fn3lb4j0e05" source="image.ai-generated" background="true" image-style="sculptural-hair-editorial" alt="Restrained medium-format fashion beauty contact-sheet composition within one portrait frame, three clean stacked studies of diverse adult models showing a soft bob, natural crop and glossy dimensional colour, consistent warm directional studio light, gallery-cream and oxblood palette, realistic hair detail, subtle film grain, no text or lettering" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1248,&quot;height&quot;:1664}"><labels><label variant="solid">AI concept imagery — not salon work</label></labels></grid-item></grid></section>